Weighing ranges: single vs multi-interval is a configuration axis. Rule 5 says use config_level when attributes vary by configuration. Here max number of scale intervals differs: 6000 for single (one weighing range), 3000 for multi-interval (per partial range). So config_level:

config_level: [
  {
    "attribute": "max_number_of_scale_intervals",
